        "text": "Find the intervals.",
        "source": "guide:what-is-due-on-my-car-right-now/body[3].items[0]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Your owner's manual lists each job by miles, by months, or both.",
          "source": "guide:what-is-due-on-my-car-right-now/body[3].items[0]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Many manuals also have a second, shorter schedule for severe driving, such as towing, mostly short trips, heavy dust or extreme heat or cold.",
          "source": "guide:what-is-due-on-my-car-right-now/body[3].items[0]#2"
